        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Because our operations include the manufacture and distribution of medical radioisotopes and other medical products, we are subject to regulation by the NRC and the departments of health of each state in which we operate and the applicable state boards of pharmacy.",
